oundations II, the second step of the journey towards university-level math." #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186046648 #edb/ref 1009 "Solidify your arithmetic, learn about variables and graphs, level up your algebra, and learn the essentials of geometry." #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186046648 #edb/ref 1012 113 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186046648 #edb/ref 1013 "MF1" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186046648 #edb/ref 1014 #uuid "042e624c-a46d-509f-a48e-61bd6d3e082c" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186048508 #edb/ref 1027 #edb/ref 17592186050481 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186048508 #edb/ref 1028 #edb/ref 17592186073738 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186048508 #edb/ref 1028 #edb/ref 17592186073739 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186048508 #edb/ref 1028 #edb/ref 17592186073740 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186048508 #edb/ref 1031 "Equivalent Ratios" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186048508 #edb/ref 1033 553 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186048508 #edb/ref 1034 1.0 #edb/ref 17592186045436] [17592186048508 #edb/ref 1035 #uuid "a587db09-9578-5d61-b811-99a95c85061d" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186048840 #edb/ref 1031 "Approximating Ratios" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186048840 #edb/ref 1033 555 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186048840 #edb/ref 1035 #uuid "c53ff2b5-bc81-56fe-a0dc-0336484fb64d" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186049495 #edb/ref 1027 #edb/ref 17592186050363 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186049495 #edb/ref 1028 #edb/ref 17592186179817 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186049495 #edb/ref 1028 #edb/ref 17592186179818 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186049495 #edb/ref 1029 #edb/ref 17592186429225 #edb/ref 17592186045436] [17592186049495 #edb/ref 1031 "Further Reasoning With Equivalent Ratios" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186049495 #edb/ref 1033 3746 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186049495 #edb/ref 1034 1.0 #edb/ref 17592186045436] [17592186049495 #edb/ref 1035 #uuid "f9324acf-7bff-528d-bb24-b67ba475ce6a" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186050174 #edb